FARE THE FARE\\nDIFF WILL BE COLLECTED PLUS CHANGE FEE AND IF NEW\\nITINERARY RESULTS IN LOWER FARE THE CHANGE FEE\\nWILL APPLY AND NO REFUND WILL BE MADE.\\nABOVE CHARGES APPLICABLE ONLY IF TKT IS\\nREISSUED BEFORE DEPARTURE OF FLT\\n--------------------------------------------------\\nCHANGE FEE DOES NOT APPLY TO INFANT NOT OCCUPYING\\nA SEAT.\\nCHARGE INR 4000 FOR NO-SHOW.\\nNOTE -\\nPASSENGER WILL BE TREATED AS NO SHOW IF THE\\nBOOKING IS NOT CANCELLED AT LEAST 24 HOURS BEFORE\\nTHE DEPARTURE OF THE FLIGHT\\n-------------------------------------------------\\nCHANGES AFTER DEPARTURE - NO SHOW PLUS CHANGE\\nFEES APPLICABLE\\n--------------------------------------------------\\nIN CASE OF REFUND AFTER DEPARTURE CHARGE NO-SHOW\\nFEES PLUS CANCELLATION FEES.\\n--------------------------------------------------\\nCHANGES AFTER DEPARTURE - NO SHOW PLUS CHANGE\\nFEES AND FARE DIFFERNCE IF ANY  APPLICABLE\\n----------------------------------------\\nTO AVOID NO-SHOW CHARGES TICKET MUST BE\\nREISSUED/REFUNDED BEFORE SCHEDULED FLIGHT\\nDEPARTURE IN TICKET\\nCANCELLATIONS\\nBEFORE DEPARTURE\\nCHARGE INR 8000.\\nNOTE -\\nREFUND-\\nUNUTILIZED TICKETS-\\n-------------------------------------------------\\nREFUND IS NOT APPLICABLE ON REMAINING FLIGHT\\nCOUPONS IF THE TICKET IS UTILIZED OUT OF SEQUENCE\\n--------------------------------------------------\\nREFUND PENALTY WAIVED IN CASE OF DEATH OF\\nPASSENGER ONLY AND OFFICIAL DOCUMENTATION\\nREQUIRED FOR SAME.\\n--------------------------------------------------\\nGST TO BE APPLIED ON THE DATE CHANGE/\\nREISSUANCE FEE PENALTIES AS BELOW -\\n1- 5 PCT FOR ALL ECONOMY CLASS.\\n2- 12 PCT FOR ALL FIRST / BUSINESS CLASS.\\n--------------------------------------------------\\nGST OF TO BE APPLIED FOR ALL CLASSES ON REFUND /\\nVOID AND NO-SHOW.\\n1- 5 PCT FOR ALL ECONOMY CLASS.\\n2- 12 PCT FOR ALL FIRST / BUSINESS CLASS.\\n--------------------------------------------------\\nWAIVERS\\n1.WAIVED FOR DEATH OF PASSENGER OR FAMILY MEMBER.\\nA COPY OF VALID DEATH CERTIFICATE ISSUED BY A\\nCOMPETENT MEDICAL AUTHORITY IS REQUIRED.\\nFAMILY MEMBERS AS DEFINED IN KU CONDITIONS OF\\nCARRIAGE OR PASSENGER AIRLINE TARIFF RULE BOOK.\\n2.NO WAIVER APPLICABLE FOR ILLNESS OF PASSENGER\\nOR FAMILY MEMBER.\\n3.CONTACT KU OFFICE FOR WAIVERS DEFINED ABOVE.\\n4. NO WAIVERS IN CASE OF VISA REFUSAL.\\n----------------------------------------------\\nOUT OF SEQUENCE TICKETS -NO REFUND\\n----------------------------------------------\\nYQ- CARRIER IMPOSED FEE\\nPLUS THE APPLICABLE GST AS PER CLASS OF BOOKING\\nIS NON REFUNDABLE.\\nANYTIME YQ CHARGES - NON REFUNDABLE.\\n----------------------------------------------\\nCANCELLATION FEE DOES NOT APPLY TO INFANT NOT\\nOCCUPYING A SEAT.\\nAFTER DEPARTURE\\nCHARGE INR 10000.\\nNOTE -\\nPARTLY UNUSED TICKETS -\\nREFUND PERMITTED DEDUCT OW FARE ON\\nTHE SAME RBD\\nIF ONE WAY FARE IS NOT AVAILABLE\\nMETIONED ON THE\\nTICKET THEN DEDUCT NEXT AVAILABLE OW\\nFARE FOR\\nWHICH THE JOURNEY HAS BEEN\\nPERFORMED.\\n--------------------------------------------------\\nYR TAX NON REFUNDABLE\\n--------------------------------------------------\\nCHARGE INR 8000 FOR NO-SHOW.\"},{\"name\":\"17. HIP/MILEAGE EXCEPTIONS\",\"value\":\"UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED\\nTHE HIGHER INTERMEDIATE POINT RULE DOES NOT APPLY FOR\\nSTOPOVERS.\\nAND - THE HIGHER INTERMEDIATE POINT RULE DOES NOT APPLY\\nFOR CONNECTIONS.\"},{\"name\":\"18. TICKET ENDORSEMENT\",\"value\":\"UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED\\nTHE ORIGINAL AND THE REISSUED TICKET MUST BE ANNOTATED -\\nVALID ON KU ONLY/ - AND - NON END - IN THE ENDORSEMENT\\nBOX.\"},{\"name\":\"19. CHILDREN DISCOUNTS\",\"value\":\"UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED\\nACCOMPANIED CHILD 2-11 - CHARGE 75 PERCENT OF THE FARE.\\nTICKET DESIGNATOR - CH AND PERCENT OF DISCOUNT\\nOR - INFANT UNDER 2 WITHOUT A SEAT - CHARGE 20 PERCENT OF\\nTHE FARE.\\nTICKET DESIGNATOR - IN AND PERCENT OF DISCOUNT.\\nNOTE -\\nWHEN INFANT REACHES 2 YEARS OF AGE ON/BEFORE\\nDEPARTURE FROM POINT OF TURNAROUND A SEAT\\nMUST BE BOOKED ON THE RETURN LEG AND THE\\nAPPLICABLE CHILD FARE CHARGED ON HALF ROUNDTRIP\\nBASIS WITH OUTBOUND INFANT FARE.\\nOR - INFANT UNDER 2 WITH A SEAT - CHARGE 75 PERCENT OF THE\\nFARE.\\nTICKET DESIGNATOR - CH AND PERCENT OF DISCOUNT\\nOR - UNACCOMPANIED CHILD 6-11 - NO DISCOUNT.\"},{\"name\":\"20. TOUR CONDUCTOR DISCOUNTS\",\"value\":\"UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED\\nTOUR CONDUCTOR - NO DISCOUNT.\"},{\"name\":\"21. AGENT DISCOUNTS\",\"value\":\"UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED\\nAGENT - NO DISCOUNT.\"},{\"name\":\"22. ALL OTHER DISCOUNTS\",\"value\":\"UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED\\nNOTE -\\nNO OTHER DISCOUNTS PERMITTED.\"},{\"name\":\"23. MISCELLANEOUS PROVISIONS\",\"value\":\"UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED\\nTHIS FARE MUST NOT BE USED AS THE HIGH OR THE LOW FARE\\nWHEN CALCULATING A DIFFERENTIAL. THIS FARE MUST NOT BE\\nUSED AS THE THROUGH FARE WHEN PRICING A FARE COMPONENT\\nWITH A DIFFERENTIAL.\"},{\"name\":\"31. VOLUNTARY CHANGES\",\"value\":\"DO A CATEGORY 31 SPECIFIC TEXT ENTRY TO VIEW CONTENTS\\nALSO REFERENCE 16 PENALTIES - FOR ADDITIONAL CHANGE INFORMATION\"},{\"name\":\"33. VOLUNTARY REFUNDS\",\"value\":\"FOR V- TYPE FARES\\nREFUND MUST BE REQUESTED BEFORE DEPARTURE OF JOURNEY.\\nREFUND REQUEST REQUIRED BEFORE ORIGINALLY SCHEDULED\\nFLIGHT OF FIRST UNUSED TICKET COUPON.\\nCHARGE INR 8000 PER PRICING UNIT. IF ALL PENALTIES IN\\nPRICING UNIT ARE PER PRICING UNIT COLLECT HIGHEST. IF MIX\\nOF PER FARE COMPONENT AND PER PRICING UNIT CALCULATE EACH\\nAS PER PRICING UNIT AND COLLECT HIGHEST.\\nFORM OF REFUND - ORIGINAL FORM OF PAYMENT. ONLY VALIDATING\\nCARRIER MAY REFUND TICKET.\\nNEW FARE FOR FULLY FLOWN FARE COMPONENTS MUST BE HIGHER\\nTHAN TICKETED FARE.\\nOR -\\nREFUND MUST BE REQUESTED BEFORE DEPARTURE OF JOURNEY.\\nREFUND REQUEST REQUIRED ANYTIME AFTER ORIGINALLY\\nSCHEDULED FLIGHT OF FIRST UNUSED TICKET COUPON.\\nCHARGE INR 16000 PER PRICING UNIT. IF ALL PENALTIES IN\\nPRICING UNIT ARE PER PRICING UNIT COLLECT HIGHEST. IF MIX\\nOF PER FARE COMPONENT AND PER PRICING UNIT CALCULATE EACH\\nAS PER PRICING UNIT AND COLLECT HIGHEST.\\nFORM OF REFUND - ORIGINAL FORM OF PAYMENT. ONLY VALIDATING\\nCARRIER MAY REFUND TICKET.\\nNEW FARE FOR FULLY FLOWN FARE COMPONENTS MUST BE HIGHER\\nTHAN TICKETED FARE.\\nOR -\\nREFUND MUST BE REQUESTED AFTER DEPARTURE OF JOURNEY.\\nREFUND REQUEST REQUIRED BEFORE ORIGINALLY SCHEDULED\\nFLIGHT OF FIRST UNUSED TICKET COUPON.\\nCHARGE INR 10000 PER PRICING UNIT. IF ALL PENALTIES IN\\nPRICING UNIT ARE PER PRICING UNIT COLLECT HIGHEST. IF MIX\\nOF PER FARE COMPONENT AND PER PRICING UNIT CALCULATE EACH\\nAS PER PRICING UNIT AND COLLECT HIGHEST.\\nFORM OF REFUND - ORIGINAL FORM OF PAYMENT. ONLY VALIDATING\\nCARRIER MAY REFUND TICKET.\\nREPRICE FLOWN PORTION USING FARES IN EFFECT ON TICKET\\nISSUANCE DATE. FOR FULLY FLOWN FARE COMPONENTS FARE BREAK\\nPOINTS MAY NOT BE CHANGED. FOR PARTIALLY FLOWN FARE\\nCOMPONENTS ONLY DESTINATION FARE BREAK POINTS MAY BE\\nCHANGED. REPRICE USING NORMAL/SPECIAL ONE WAY/ROUND TRIP\\nFARES/ANY RULE/FARE CLASS/RBD. PUBLIC FARES ARE USED IF\\nTICKETED FARE IS IN PUBLIC TARIFF. QUALIFIED PRIVATE\\nFARES OR PUBLIC FARES ARE USED IF TICKETED FARE IS IN\\nPRIVATE TARIFF. NEW FARE FOR FULLY FLOWN FARE COMPONENTS\\nMUST BE HIGHER THAN TICKETED FARE.\\nOR -\\nREFUND MUST BE REQUESTED AFTER DEPARTURE OF JOURNEY.\\nREFUND REQUEST REQUIRED ANYTIME AFTER ORIGINALLY\\nSCHEDULED FLIGHT OF FIRST UNUSED TICKET COUPON.\\nCHARGE INR 18000 PER PRICING UNIT. IF ALL PENALTIES IN\\nPRICING UNIT ARE PER PRICING UNIT COLLECT HIGHEST. IF MIX\\nOF PER FARE COMPONENT AND PER PRICING UNIT CALCULATE EACH\\nAS PER PRICING UNIT AND COLLECT HIGHEST.\\nFORM OF REFUND - ORIGINAL FORM OF PAYMENT. ONLY VALIDATING\\nCARRIER MAY REFUND TICKET.\\nREPRICE FLOWN PORTION USING FARES IN EFFECT ON TICKET\\nISSUANCE DATE. FOR FULLY FLOWN FARE COMPONENTS FARE BREAK\\nPOINTS MAY NOT BE CHANGED. FOR PARTIALLY FLOWN FARE\\nCOMPONENTS ONLY DESTINATION FARE BREAK POINTS MAY BE\\nCHANGED. REPRICE USING NORMAL/SPECIAL ONE WAY/ROUND TRIP\\nFARES/ANY RULE/FARE CLASS/RBD. PUBLIC FARES ARE USED IF\\nTICKETED FARE IS IN PUBLIC TARIFF. QUALIFIED PRIVATE\\nFARES OR PUBLIC FARES ARE USED IF TICKETED FARE IS IN\\nPRIVATE TARIFF. NEW FARE FOR FULLY FLOWN FARE COMPONENTS\\nMUST BE HIGHER THAN TICKETED FARE.\"}]}],\"Identifier\":{\"value\":\"o1_FR\"},\"ReferenceList\":[{\"@type\":\"ReferenceListFlight\",\"Flight\":[{\"@type\":\"FlightDetail\",\"distance\":2262,\"duration\":\"PT5H25M\",\"carrier\":\"KU\",\"number\":\"358\",\"equipment\":\"32N\",\"id\":\"s5\",\"Departure\":{\"@type\":\"DepartureDetail\",\"terminal\":\"3\",\"location\":\"COK\",\"date\":\"2026-03-27\",\"time\":\"03:15:00\"},\"Arrival\":{\"@type\":\"ArrivalDetail\",\"terminal\":\"4\",\"location\":\"KWI\",\"date\":\"2026-03-27\",\"time\":\"06:10:00\"},\"AvailabilitySourceCode\":\"P\"},{\"@type\":\"FlightDetail\",\"distance\":2500,\"duration\":\"PT6H5M\",\"carrier\":\"KU\",\"number\":\"171\",\"equipment\":\"338\",\"id\":\"s6\",\"Departure\":{\"@type\":\"DepartureDetail\",\"terminal\":\"4\",\"location\":\"KWI\",\"date\":\"2026-03-27\",\"time\":\"08:40:00\"},\"Arrival\":{\"@type\":\"ArrivalDetail\",\"terminal\":\"2\",\"location\":\"FRA\",\"date\":\"2026-03-27\",\"time\":\"12:45:00\"},\"AvailabilitySourceCode\":\"P\"}]}]}}', 200, 0.687461, '2026-03-20 08:39:27'),
