(73, NULL, '/air/farerule/farerules/fromcatalogproductofferings?catalogProductOfferingsIdentifier=4bbeb0ff-eb52-440b-8c9c-73f93a91b311&catalogProductOfferingID=o2&productIDs=p8&fareRuleType=LongText', 'GET', 'null', '{\"FareRuleListResponse\":{\"@type\":\"FareRuleListResponse\",\"transactionId\":\"b746c6f35ecd5687e31134233cae67cf\",\"FareRule\":[{\"@type\":\"FareRuleText\",\"ruleNumber\":\"AL12\",\"tariffNumber\":\"001\",\"id\":\"QHYO6L\",\"Flight\":[{\"@type\":\"Flight\",\"FlightRef\":\"s45\"},{\"@type\":\"Flight\",\"FlightRef\":\"s46\"}],\"TextFareRule\":[{\"name\":\"0.  APPLICATION AND OTHER CONDITIONS\",\"value\":\"RULE - 001/AL12\\nUNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED\\nUX ECONOMY LITE FARES\\nAPPLICATION\\nAREA\\nTHESE FARES APPLY\\nBETWEEN AREA 1 AND AREA 2.\\nCLASS OF SERVICE\\nTHESE FARES APPLY FOR ECONOMY CLASS SERVICE.\\nTYPES OF TRANSPORTATION\\nFARES GOVERNED BY THIS RULE CAN BE USED TO CREATE\\nONE-WAY/ROUND-TRIP/SINGLE OPEN-JAW/DOUBLE OPEN-JAW\\nJOURNEYS.\\nCAPACITY LIMITATIONS\\nTHE CARRIER SHALL LIMIT THE NUMBER OF PASSENGERS CARRIED\\nON ANY ONE FLIGHT AT FARES GOVERNED BY THIS RULE AND SUCH\\nFARES WILL NOT NECESSARILY BE AVAILABLE ON ALL FLIGHTS.\\nTHE NUMBER OF SEATS WHICH THE CARRIER SHALL MAKE\\nAVAILABLE ON A GIVEN FLIGHT WILL BE DETERMINED BY THE\\nCARRIERS BEST JUDGMENT\"},{\"name\":\"2.  DAY/TIME\",\"value\":\"UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED   NOTE - RULE DT02 IN IPRG100\\nAPPLIES\"},{\"name\":\"3.  SEASONALITY\",\"value\":\"UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED   NOTE - RULE AEY3 IN IPRG100\\nAPPLIES\\nBETWEEN AREA 2 AND THE UNITED STATES FOR HIGH SEASON FARES\\nFROM AREA 2 -\\nPERMITTED 18DEC THROUGH 12JAN OR 25MAR THROUGH 02APR OR\\n14JUN THROUGH 25AUG FOR EACH TRANSATLANTIC SECTOR.\\nTO AREA 2 -\\nPERMITTED 18DEC THROUGH 12JAN OR 02APR THROUGH 12APR OR\\n15MAY THROUGH 13JUL OR 20AUG THROUGH 03SEP FOR EACH\\nTRANSATLANTIC SECTOR.\"},{\"name\":\"4.  FLIGHT APPLICATION\",\"value\":\"BETWEEN AREA 2 AND THE UNITED STATES FOR ONE WAY Q- TYPE FARES\\nFROM AREA 2 -\\nFOR TRAVEL ON/BEFORE 01SEP 25\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT INCLUDES TRAVEL BETWEEN MAD AND ROM\\nTHEN THAT TRAVEL MUST BE ON\\nONE OR MORE OF THE FOLLOWING\\nANY UX FLIGHT OPERATED BY UX.\\nAND\\nTHE FARE COMPONENT MUST INCLUDE TRAVEL VIA TRANSATLANTIC\\nSECTORS ON\\nONE OR MORE OF THE FOLLOWING\\nANY UX FLIGHT.\\nAND\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT INCLUDES TRAVEL WITHIN AREA 2\\nTHEN THAT TRAVEL MUST BE ON\\nONE OR MORE OF THE FOLLOWING\\nANY UX FLIGHT\\nANY 9B FLIGHT\\nANY W2 FLIGHT\\nANY A3 FLIGHT\\nANY AZ FLIGHT\\nANY KL FLIGHT\\nANY LG FLIGHT\\nANY LO FLIGHT\\nANY ME FLIGHT\\nANY SK FLIGHT\\nANY SU FLIGHT\\nANY TK FLIGHT\\nANY ET FLIGHT\\nANY EY FLIGHT\\nANY PM FLIGHT\\nANY NT FLIGHT\\nLY FLIGHTS 0300 THROUGH 0399\\nOK FLIGHTS 0700 THROUGH 0799\\nANY BT FLIGHT\\nANY I6 FLIGHT\\nANY FB FLIGHT\\nANY MS FLIGHT\\nANY RO FLIGHT\\nANY FI FLIGHT\\nANY QS FLIGHT\\nANY GQ FLIGHT.\\nAND\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT INCLUDES TRAVEL WITHIN AREA 1\\nTHEN THAT TRAVEL MUST BE ON\\nONE OR MORE OF THE FOLLOWING\\nANY UX FLIGHT\\nANY 5U FLIGHT\\nANY AD FLIGHT\\nANY AR FLIGHT\\nANY H5 FLIGHT\\nANY CM FLIGHT\\nANY CU FLIGHT\\nANY G3 FLIGHT\\nANY DL FLIGHT\\nANY BB FLIGHT\\nANY ZP FLIGHT\\nANY AM FLIGHT\\nANY LA FLIGHT\\nANY H2 FLIGHT\\nANY H8 FLIGHT\\nANY AV FLIGHT\\nANY TA FLIGHT\\nANY LR FLIGHT\\nANY 2K FLIGHT.\\nFROM AREA 2 -\\nFOR TRAVEL ON/AFTER 02SEP 25 AND ON/BEFORE 04NOV 25\\nTHE FARE COMPONENT MUST NOT BE ON\\nONE OR MORE OF THE FOLLOWING\\nUX FLIGHT 091.\\nAND\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT INCLUDES TRAVEL BETWEEN MAD AND ROM\\nTHEN THAT TRAVEL MUST BE ON\\nONE OR MORE OF THE FOLLOWING\\nANY UX FLIGHT OPERATED BY UX.\\nAND\\nTHE FARE COMPONENT MUST INCLUDE TRAVEL VIA TRANSATLANTIC\\nSECTORS ON\\nONE OR MORE OF THE FOLLOWING\\nANY UX FLIGHT.\\nAND\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT INCLUDES TRAVEL WITHIN AREA 2\\nTHEN THAT TRAVEL MUST BE ON\\nONE OR MORE OF THE FOLLOWING\\nANY UX FLIGHT\\nANY 9B FLIGHT\\nANY W2 FLIGHT\\nANY A3 FLIGHT\\nANY AZ FLIGHT\\nANY KL FLIGHT\\nANY LG FLIGHT\\nANY LO FLIGHT\\nANY ME FLIGHT\\nANY SK FLIGHT\\nANY SU FLIGHT\\nANY TK FLIGHT\\nANY ET FLIGHT\\nANY EY FLIGHT\\nANY PM FLIGHT\\nANY NT FLIGHT\\nLY FLIGHTS 0300 THROUGH 0399\\nOK FLIGHTS 0700 THROUGH 0799\\nANY BT FLIGHT\\nANY I6 FLIGHT\\nANY FB FLIGHT\\nANY MS FLIGHT\\nANY RO FLIGHT\\nANY FI FLIGHT\\nANY QS FLIGHT\\nANY GQ FLIGHT.\\nAND\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT INCLUDES TRAVEL WITHIN AREA 1\\nTHEN THAT TRAVEL MUST BE ON\\nONE OR MORE OF THE FOLLOWING\\nANY UX FLIGHT\\nANY 5U FLIGHT\\nANY AD FLIGHT\\nANY AR FLIGHT\\nANY H5 FLIGHT\\nANY CM FLIGHT\\nANY CU FLIGHT\\nANY G3 FLIGHT\\nANY DL FLIGHT\\nANY BB FLIGHT\\nANY ZP FLIGHT\\nANY AM FLIGHT\\nANY LA FLIGHT\\nANY H2 FLIGHT\\nANY H8 FLIGHT\\nANY AV FLIGHT\\nANY TA FLIGHT\\nANY LR FLIGHT\\nANY 2K FLIGHT.\\nFROM AREA 2 -\\nFOR TRAVEL ON/AFTER 05NOV 25\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT INCLUDES TRAVEL BETWEEN MAD AND ROM\\nTHEN THAT TRAVEL MUST BE ON\\nONE OR MORE OF THE FOLLOWING\\nANY UX FLIGHT OPERATED BY UX.\\nAND\\nTHE FARE COMPONENT MUST INCLUDE TRAVEL VIA TRANSATLANTIC\\nSECTORS ON\\nONE OR MORE OF THE FOLLOWING\\nANY UX FLIGHT.\\nAND\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT INCLUDES TRAVEL WITHIN AREA 2\\nTHEN THAT TRAVEL MUST BE ON\\nONE OR MORE OF THE FOLLOWING\\nANY UX FLIGHT\\nANY 9B FLIGHT\\nANY W2 FLIGHT\\nANY A3 FLIGHT\\nANY AZ FLIGHT\\nANY KL FLIGHT\\nANY LG FLIGHT\\nANY LO FLIGHT\\nANY ME FLIGHT\\nANY SK FLIGHT\\nANY SU FLIGHT\\nANY TK FLIGHT\\nANY ET FLIGHT\\nANY EY FLIGHT\\nANY PM FLIGHT\\nANY NT FLIGHT\\nLY FLIGHTS 0300 THROUGH 0399\\nOK FLIGHTS 0700 THROUGH 0799\\nANY BT FLIGHT\\nANY I6 FLIGHT\\nANY FB FLIGHT\\nANY MS FLIGHT\\nANY RO FLIGHT\\nANY FI FLIGHT\\nANY QS FLIGHT\\nANY GQ FLIGHT.\\nAND\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT INCLUDES TRAVEL WITHIN AREA 1\\nTHEN THAT TRAVEL MUST BE ON\\nONE OR MORE OF THE FOLLOWING\\nANY UX FLIGHT\\nANY 5U FLIGHT\\nANY AD FLIGHT\\nANY AR FLIGHT\\nANY H5 FLIGHT\\nANY CM FLIGHT\\nANY CU FLIGHT\\nANY G3 FLIGHT\\nANY DL FLIGHT\\nANY BB FLIGHT\\nANY ZP FLIGHT\\nANY AM FLIGHT\\nANY LA FLIGHT\\nANY H2 FLIGHT\\nANY H8 FLIGHT\\nANY AV FLIGHT\\nANY TA FLIGHT\\nANY LR FLIGHT\\nANY 2K FLIGHT.\"},{\"name\":\"5.  ADVANCE RES/TICKETING\",\"value\":\"BETWEEN AREA 1 AND AREA 2\\nRESERVATIONS ARE REQUIRED FOR ALL SECTORS.\\nWHEN RESERVATIONS ARE MADE AT LEAST 3 DAYS BEFORE\\nDEPARTURE TICKETING MUST BE COMPLETED WITHIN 3 DAYS AFTER\\nRESERVATIONS ARE MADE OR AT LEAST 3 DAYS BEFORE DEPARTURE\\nWHICHEVER IS EARLIER.\\nOR - RESERVATIONS FOR ALL SECTORS AND TICKETING MUST BE\\nCOMPLETED AT THE SAME TIME.\\nNOTE -\\nDIFFERENCE COULD EXIST BETWEEN THE CRS\\nLAST TICKETING DATE AND TTL ROBOT REMARK.\\nTHE MOST RESTRICTIVE DATE PREVAILS.\"},{\"name\":\"6.  MINIMUM STAY\",\"value\":\"NONE BETWEEN AREA 1 AND AREA 2 FOR ONE WAY FARES\"},{\"name\":\"7.  MAXIMUM STAY\",\"value\":\"NONE FOR ONE WAY FARES\"},{\"name\":\"8.  STOPOVERS\",\"value\":\"BETWEEN AREA 2 AND AREA 1 FOR ECONOMY OW UNBUNDLED FARES\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT IS ON\\nONE OR MORE OF THE FOLLOWING\\nANY UX FLIGHT\\n2 FREE STOPOVERS PERMITTED ON THE PRICING UNIT - 1 IN\\nEACH DIRECTION.\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT IS ON\\nONE OR MORE OF THE FOLLOWING\\nANY UX FLIGHT\\n2 STOPOVERS PERMITTED ON THE PRICING UNIT - 1 IN EACH\\nDIRECTION AT EUR 70.00/USD 100.00 EACH.\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT IS NOT ON\\nONE OR MORE OF THE FOLLOWING\\nANY UX FLIGHT\\nNO STOPOVERS PERMITTED.\"},{\"name\":\"9.  TRANSFERS\",\"value\":\"BETWEEN AREA 1 AND AREA 2 FOR ECONOMY OW UNBUNDLED FARES\\nUNLIMITED TRANSFERS PERMITTED ON THE PRICING UNIT\\nFARE BREAK AND EMBEDDED SURFACE SECTORS NOT PERMITTED ON\\nTHE FARE COMPONENT.\\nNOTE -\\nTRANSFERS LIMITTED TO THE ROUTING MAP INDICATED IN\\nTHE FARE RECORD.\"},{\"name\":\"10. PERMITTED COMBINATIONS\",\"value\":\"UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED\\nCIRCLE TRIPS NOT PERMITTED.\\nEND-ON-END NOT PERMITTED. SIDE TRIPS NOT PERMITTED\\nAPPLICABLE ADD-ON CONSTRUCTION IS ADDRESSED IN\\nMISCELLANEOUS PROVISIONS - CATEGORY 23.\\nOPEN JAWS/ROUND TRIPS\\nFARES MAY BE COMBINED ON A HALF ROUND TRIP BASIS\\n-TO FORM SINGLE OR DOUBLE OPEN JAWS.\\nMILEAGE OF THE OPEN SEGMENT MUST BE EQUAL/LESS THAN\\nMILEAGE OF THE SHORTEST FLOWN FARE COMPONENT.\\n-TO FORM ROUND TRIPS\\nPROVIDED -\\nCOMBINATIONS ARE WITH ANY FARE FOR CARRIER UX IN ANY\\nRULE IN TARIFF\\nIPRA    - USA/CANADA-AREA 2/3 AND GUAM-AREA 2 VIA\\nATLANTIC\\nIPREUAF - BETWEEN EUROPE-AFRICA\\nIPREUME - BETWEEN EUROPE-THE MIDDLE EAST\\nIPREURP - WITHIN EUROPE-INTERNATIONAL\\nIPRSAA2 - BETWEEN THE WESTERN HEMISPHERE-AREA 2 VIA\\nATLANTIC.\\nCOMBINATIONS ARE WITH ANY -JJ/-SS TYPE FARES FOR\\nCARRIER UX WITH ANY RULE IN ANY PRIVATE TARIFF.\"},{\"name\":\"11. BLACKOUT DATES\",\"value\":\"BETWEEN AREA 2 AND NYC FOR ONE WAY Q- TYPE FARES\\nFROM AREA 2 -\\nTRAVEL IS NOT PERMITTED 23OCT 25 THROUGH 03DEC 25.\"},{\"name\":\"12. SURCHARGES\",\"value\":\"BETWEEN AREA 2 AND AREA 1\\nORIGINATING AREA 1 -\\nIF INFANT UNDER 02 WITHOUT A SEAT.\\nOR - INE UNDER 02.\\nOR - INFANT WITHOUT A SEAT RESIDENT UNDER 02.\\nOR - INCLUSIVE TOUR INFANT WITHOUT A SEAT UNDER 02.\\nOR - TIMESAVER INFANT WITHOUT A SEAT UNDER 02.\\nOR - CONTRACT BULK INFANT WITHOUT A SEAT UNDER 02.\\nOR - MISSIONARY INFANT WITHOUT A SEAT UNDER 02.\\nOR - MILITARY INFANT WITHOUT A SEAT UNDER 02.\\nOR - PIF UNDER 02.\\nOR - FREQUENT FLYER INFANT WITHOUT A SEAT UNDER 02.\\nOR - FAMILY PLAN INFANT WITHOUT A SEAT UNDER 02.\\nOR - VISIT FRIENDS/RELATIVES INFANT WITHOUT A SEAT UNDER\\n02.\\nTHERE IS NO CHARGE FOR TRAVEL.\\nORIGINATING AREA 1 -\\nFOR TRAVEL ON/AFTER 01DEC 23\\nA SURCHARGE OF USD 225.00 PER FARE COMPONENT WILL BE\\nADDED TO THE APPLICABLE FARE FOR TRAVEL FOR ANY SECTOR\\nBETWEEN BRAZIL AND AREA 2.\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT INCLUDES TRAVEL BETWEEN AHO AND ROM\\nA SECURITY SURCHARGE OF EUR 100.00 PER FARE COMPONENT\\nWILL BE ADDED TO THE APPLICABLE FARE. APPLIES PER ADULT.\\nCHILD/INFANT DISCOUNTS APPLY.\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT INCLUDES TRAVEL BETWEEN SAO AND SSA\\nA SECURITY SURCHARGE OF USD 105.00 PER FARE COMPONENT\\nWILL BE ADDED TO THE APPLICABLE FARE. APPLIES PER ADULT.\\nCHILD/INFANT DISCOUNTS APPLY.\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT INCLUDES TRAVEL BETWEEN BUE AND COR\\nA SECURITY SURCHARGE OF USD 90.00 PER FARE COMPONENT\\nWILL BE ADDED TO THE APPLICABLE FARE. APPLIES PER ADULT.\\nCHILD/INFANT DISCOUNTS APPLY.\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT INCLUDES TRAVEL BETWEEN MVD AND BUE\\nA SECURITY SURCHARGE OF USD 100.00 PER FARE COMPONENT\\nWILL BE ADDED TO THE APPLICABLE FARE. APPLIES PER ADULT.\\nCHILD/INFANT DISCOUNTS APPLY.\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT INCLUDES TRAVEL BETWEEN ASU AND BUE\\nA SECURITY SURCHARGE OF USD 150.00 PER FARE COMPONENT\\nWILL BE ADDED TO THE APPLICABLE FARE. APPLIES PER ADULT.\\nCHILD/INFANT DISCOUNTS APPLY.\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT INCLUDES TRAVEL BETWEEN MVD AND SAO\\nA SECURITY SURCHARGE OF USD 175.00 PER FARE COMPONENT\\nWILL BE ADDED TO THE APPLICABLE FARE. APPLIES PER ADULT.\\nCHILD/INFANT DISCOUNTS APPLY.\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT INCLUDES TRAVEL BETWEEN TLV AND AREA\\n2 ON\\nONE OR MORE OF THE FOLLOWING\\nANY LY FLIGHT\\nA SECURITY SURCHARGE OF USD 200.00 PER FARE COMPONENT\\nWILL BE ADDED TO THE APPLICABLE FARE. APPLIES PER ADULT.\\nCHILD/INFANT DISCOUNTS APPLY.\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT INCLUDES TRAVEL BETWEEN PTY AND CIX\\nA SECURITY SURCHARGE OF USD 55.00 PER FARE COMPONENT\\nWILL BE ADDED TO THE APPLICABLE FARE. APPLIES PER ADULT.\\nCHILD/INFANT DISCOUNTS APPLY.\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT INCLUDES TRAVEL BETWEEN PTY AND MDE\\nA SECURITY SURCHARGE OF USD 100.00 PER FARE COMPONENT\\nWILL BE ADDED TO THE APPLICABLE FARE. APPLIES PER ADULT.\\nCHILD/INFANT DISCOUNTS APPLY.\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT INCLUDES TRAVEL BETWEEN PTY AND ADZ\\nOR\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT INCLUDES TRAVEL BETWEEN PTY AND BAQ\\nOR\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT INCLUDES TRAVEL BETWEEN PTY AND BGA\\nOR\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT INCLUDES TRAVEL BETWEEN PTY AND CLO\\nOR\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT INCLUDES TRAVEL BETWEEN PTY AND CTG\\nOR\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT INCLUDES TRAVEL BETWEEN PTY AND CUC\\nOR\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT INCLUDES TRAVEL BETWEEN PTY AND EYP\\nOR\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT INCLUDES TRAVEL BETWEEN PTY AND