N BOG/MDE AND\\nADZ/LET ON\\nONE OR MORE OF THE FOLLOWING\\nANY AV FLIGHT OPERATED BY AV\\nANY TA FLIGHT OPERATED BY TA\\nANY LR FLIGHT OPERATED BY LR\\nANY 2K FLIGHT OPERATED BY 2K\\nA SECURITY SURCHARGE OF USD 80.00 PER FARE COMPONENT\\nWILL BE ADDED TO THE APPLICABLE FARE. APPLIES PER ADULT.\\nCHILD/INFANT DISCOUNTS APPLY.\\nIF THE FARE COMPONENT INCLUDES TRAVEL BETWEEN PAR AND GVA\\nON\\nONE OR MORE OF THE FOLLOWING\\nANY UX FLIGHT OPERATED BY AF\\nANY AF FLIGHT OPERATED BY AF\\nFOR TRAVEL ON/AFTER 19JUN 26\\nA SECURITY SURCHARGE OF EUR 80.00 PER FARE COMPONENT\\nWILL BE ADDED TO THE APPLICABLE FARE. APPLIES PER\\nADULT. CHILD/INFANT DISCOUNTS APPLY.\"},{\"name\":\"15. SALES RESTRICTIONS\",\"value\":\"BETWEEN AREA 1 AND AREA 2\\nTICKETS MUST BE ISSUED ON UX AND MAY NOT BE SOLD IN\\nVENEZUELA/RUSSIA/RUSSIA (EAST OF THE URALS)/ARGENTINA/\\nBOLIVIA/AFGHANISTAN/TURKMENISTAN/KYRGYZSTAN/BELARUS/\\nTAJIKISTAN/KAZAKHSTAN/PAKISTAN/UZBEKISTAN/AZERBAIJAN AND\\nMAY ONLY BE SOLD IN AREA 1/AREA 2/AREA 3\\nTICKETS MAY NOT BE ISSUED BY PTA. EXTENSION OF TICKET\\nVALIDITY IS NOT PERMITTED.\"},{\"name\":\"16. PENALTIES\",\"value\":\"BETWEEN AREA 1 AND AREA 2\\nCANCELLATIONS\\nANY TIME\\nTICKET IS NON-REFUNDABLE IN CASE OF CANCEL/REFUND.\\nCHANGES\\nANY TIME\\nCHARGE EUR 150.00/USD 175.00 FOR REISSUE/REVALIDATION.\\nCHILD/INFANT DISCOUNTS APPLY.\\nNOTE -\\nNO SHOW NOT PERMITTED FOR CHANGES AND REFUND.\\nCHARGE FOR CHANGES APPLIES PER TRANSACTION/TICKET\\nAND PERSON TO ALL PASSENGER TYPES.\\nCHANGES RULES APPLY PER FARE COMPONENT/DIRECTION.\\nREFUND RULES APPLY PER FARE COMPONENT/DIRECTION.\\nNOTE -\\nIN CASE OF PASSENGERS HOSPITAL ADMISSION OR DEATH\\nOF PASSENGER OR FAMILY MEMBER PLEASE CONTACT WITH\\nTHE AIRLINE.\\n------------------------------------------------\\nTICKET IS NOT TRANSFERABLE TO ANOTHER PERSON.\\n------------------------------------------------\\nIT WILL BE CONSIDERED NO-SHOW WHEN A PASSENGER\\nHAS NOT ADVISED THE AIRLINE THAT WILL NOT BE ABLE\\nTO MAKE THE FLIGHT IN WHICH THEY ARE BOOKED ON.\\nBEING NECESSARY THAH THE PASSENGER HAS CANCELED\\nAND REFUNDED OR CHANGED THE TICKET AT THE SAME\\nTIME.\\n------------------------------------------------\\nREFUND AND CHANGES CONDITIONS APPLY WITHIN TICKET\\nVALIDITY.\\n------------------------------------------------\\nIN CASE OF FARE COMBINATION CHARGE THE HIGHEST\\nFEE OF ALL CHANGED FARE COMPONENTS.\\n------------------------------------------------\\nA CHANGE IS A DATE/FLIGHT/ROUTING/BOOKING CODE\\nCHANGE.\\n------------------------------------------------\\nREISSUE MUST BE MADE AT THE SAME TIME AS CHANGE\\nOF RESERVATION BUT NO LATER TAN SCHEDULED\\nDEPARTURE TIME OF FLIGHT BEING CHANGED.\\n------------------------------------------------\\n---- REPRICING CONDITIONS ----\\nA.BEFORE DEPARTURE OF JOURNEY WHEN THE FIRST FARE\\nCOMPONENT IS CHANGED THE ITINERARY MUST BE\\nRE-PRICED USING CURRENT FARES IN EFFECT ON THE\\nDATE THE TICKET IS REISSUED.\\nB.BEFORE DEPARTURE OF JOURNEY WHEN CHANGES ARE TO\\nBOOKING CODE ONLY IN THE FIRST FARE COMPONENT AND\\nRESULT IN A HIGHER FARE THE ITINERARY MUST BE\\nRE-PRICED USING HISTORICAL FARES IN EFFECT ON THE\\nPREVIOUS TICKETING DATE OR USING CURRENT FARE IN\\nEFFECT ON THE DATE THE TICKET IS REISSUED -\\nWICHEVER IS LOWER.\\nC. BEFORE DEPARTURE OF JOURNEY WHEN THERE ARE NO\\nCHANGES TO THE FIRST FARE COMPONENT BUT OTHER\\nFARE COMPONENTS ARE CHANGED THE ITINERARY MUST BE\\nRE-PRICED USING HISTORICAL FAERS IN EFFECT ON THE\\nPREVIOUS TICKETING DATE OR USING CURRENT FARES IN\\nEFFECT ON THE DATE THE TICKET IS REISSUED -\\nWHICHEVER IS LOWER.\\nD. AFTER DEPARTURE OF JOURNEY THE ITINERARY MUST\\nBE RE-PRICED USING HISTORICAL FARES IN EFFECT ON\\nTHE PREVIOUS TICKETING DATE.\\n------------------------------------------------\\nWHEN CHANGES ARE MADE NEW FARE AND RBD MUST BE\\nEQUAL OR HIGHER THAN ORIGINAL TICKET.\\n------------------------------------------------\\nANY NON-REFUNDABLE AMOUNT AND/OR CANCELLATION\\nPENALTY FROM A PREVIOUS TICKET REMAINS\\nNON-REFUNDABLE FOLLOWING A CHANGE.\\n------------------------------------------------\\n-IF REFUND APPLY PER FARE COMPONENT /FC/-\\nWHEN COMBINING NON-REFUNDABLE FARES WITH A\\nREFUNDABLE FARES -\\n1-THE AMOUNT PAID ON EACH REFUNDABLE FARE\\nCOMPONENT IS REFUNDED\\n2-THE AMOUNT PAID ON EACH NON-REFUNDABLE FARE\\nCOMPONENT WILL NOT BE REFUNDED\\n3-WHEN COMBINING FARES CHARGE THE SUM OF THE\\nCANCELLATION FEES OF ALL CANCELLED FARE\\nCOMPONENTS\\n------------------------------------------------\\n-IF REFUND APPLY PER PRICING UNIT /PU/-\\nWHEN COMBINING NON-REFUNDABLE FARES WITH\\nREFUNDABLE FARES -\\n1. THE MOST RESTRICTIVE CANCELLATION CONDITION\\nAPPLIES TO THE ENTIRE PRICING UNIT.\\n2. THE HIGHEST CANCELLATION PENALTY WITHIN THE\\nPRICING UNIT WILL BE CHARGED.\\n------------------------------------------------\\n-IF MIX OF FC AND PU-\\nCALCULATE EACH AS SPECIFIED AND CHARGE THE SUM OF\\nTHE CANCELLATIONS FEES.\\n------------------------------------------------\\nREFUND OF UNUSED TAXES FEES AND CHARGES PAID TO\\nTHIRD PARTIES PERMITTED EXCEPT FOR TAXES THAT ARE\\nLEGALLY NON-REFUNDABLE.\\nYQ/YR WILL BE REFUNDED IF THE FARE IS REFUNDABLE\\nOTHERWISE IT WOULD NOT BE ALLOWED.\\n------------------------------------------------\\nREFUND FOR PARTLY USED TICKET-\\nIF A RETURN TICKET SHALL BE USED FOR ONE WAY\\nTRAVEL -\\nTHE DIFFERENCE BETWEEN THE RETURN FARE AND THE\\nAPPLICABLE ONE WAY FARE WILL/SHALL BE CALCULATED.\\nAPPLICABLE ONE WAY IS THE ONE WAY FARE WITHIN THE\\nSAME OR HIGHER RBD.\\n------------------------------------------------\"},{\"name\":\"17. HIP/MILEAGE EXCEPTIONS\",\"value\":\"UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED\\nTHE HIGHER INTERMEDIATE POINT RULE DOES NOT APPLY FOR\\nCONNECTIONS.\\nNOTE -\\nDMC/HIP/EXCESS OF MILEAGE WILL NOT APPLY TO THESE\\nFARES.\\nAND - THE HIGHER INTERMEDIATE POINT RULE DOES NOT APPLY\\nFOR STOPOVERS.\\nNOTE -\\nDMC/HIP/EXCESS OF MILEAGE WILL NOT APPLY TO THESE\\nFARES.\"},{\"name\":\"18. TICKET ENDORSEMENT\",\"value\":\"UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED\\nTHE ORIGINAL AND THE REISSUED TICKET MUST BE ANNOTATED -\\nCHGS WITH RESTR AND NONREF - IN THE ENDORSEMENT BOX.\\nAND - THE ORIGINAL AND THE REISSUED TICKET MUST BE\\nANNOTATED - RESTRICTIONS APPLY - IN THE FORM OF\\nPAYMENT BOX.\"},{\"name\":\"19. CHILDREN DISCOUNTS\",\"value\":\"BETWEEN AREA 2 AND AREA 1\\nACCOMPANIED CHILD 2-11 - CHARGE 75 PERCENT OF THE FARE.\\nTICKET DESIGNATOR - CH.\\nMUST BE ACCOMPANIED ON ALL FLIGHTS IN SAME COMPARTMENT\\nBY ADULT 18 OR OLDER\\nOR - UNACCOMPANIED CHILD 5-11 - CHARGE 75 PERCENT OF THE\\nFARE.\\nTICKET DESIGNATOR - CH.\\nNOTE -\\nAN ACCEPTANCE LIMIT ON THE NUMBER OF UNACCOMPANIED\\nCHILD WILL BE CONSIDER\\nOR - INFANT UNDER 2 WITH A SEAT - CHARGE 75 PERCENT OF THE\\nFARE.\\nTICKET DESIGNATOR - IN.\\nMUST BE ACCOMPANIED ON ALL FLIGHTS IN SAME\\nCOMPARTMENT BY ADULT 18 OR OLDER.\\nNOTE -\\nAN INFANT UNDER TWO YEARS WHO MAY TURN 2 YEARS\\nOF AGE BEFORE THE END OF THE TRIP MUST PAY A\\nCHILD FARE FOR THE ENTIRE JOURNEY\\nOR - 1ST INFANT UNDER 2 WITHOUT A SEAT - CHARGE 10 PERCENT\\nOF THE FARE.\\nTICKET DESIGNATOR - IN.\\nMUST BE ACCOMPANIED ON ALL FLIGHTS IN SAME\\nCOMPARTMENT BY ADULT 18 OR OLDER.\\nCNE 2-11 - CHARGE 75 PERCENT OF THE FARE.\\nTICKET DESIGNATOR - CH.\\nMUST BE ACCOMPANIED ON ALL FLIGHTS IN SAME\\nCOMPARTMENT BY NEG 18 OR OLDER\\nOR - UNACCOMPANIED CHILD 5-11 - CHARGE 75 PERCENT OF THE\\nFARE.\\nTICKET DESIGNATOR - CH.\\nNOTE -\\nAN ACCEPTANCE LIMIT ON THE NUMBER OF UNACCOMPANIED\\nCHILD WILL BE CONSIDER\\nOR - INE UNDER 2 - CHARGE 75 PERCENT OF THE FARE.\\nTICKET DESIGNATOR - IN.\\nMUST BE ACCOMPANIED ON ALL FLIGHTS IN SAME\\nCOMPARTMENT BY NEG 18 OR OLDER.\\nNOTE -\\nAN INFANT UNDER TWO YEARS WHO MAY TURN 2 YEARS\\nOF AGE BEFORE THE END OF THE TRIP MUST PAY A\\nCHILD FARE FOR THE ENTIRE JOURNEY\\nOR - 1ST INFANT UNDER 2 WITHOUT A SEAT - CHARGE 10 PERCENT\\nOF THE FARE.\\nTICKET DESIGNATOR - IN.\\nMUST BE ACCOMPANIED ON ALL FLIGHTS IN SAME\\nCOMPARTMENT BY NEG 18 OR OLDER.\\nCONTRACT BULK CHILD 2-11 - CHARGE 75 PERCENT OF THE FARE.\\nTICKET DESIGNATOR - CH.\\nMUST BE ACCOMPANIED ON ALL FLIGHTS IN SAME\\nCOMPARTMENT BY ADULT 18 OR OLDER\\nOR - UNACCOMPANIED CHILD 5-11 - CHARGE 75 PERCENT OF THE\\nFARE.\\nTICKET DESIGNATOR - CH.\\nNOTE -\\nAN ACCEPTANCE LIMIT ON THE NUMBER OF UNACCOMPANIED\\nCHILD WILL BE CONSIDER\\nOR - CONTRACT BULK INFANT WITH A SEAT UNDER 2 - CHARGE 75\\nPERCENT OF THE FARE.\\nTICKET DESIGNATOR - IN.\\nMUST BE ACCOMPANIED ON ALL FLIGHTS IN SAME\\nCOMPARTMENT BY ADULT 18 OR OLDER.\\nNOTE -\\nAN INFANT UNDER TWO YEARS WHO MAY TURN 2 YEARS\\nOF AGE BEFORE THE END OF THE TRIP MUST PAY A\\nCHILD FARE FOR THE ENTIRE JOURNEY\\nOR - 1ST CONTRACT BULK INFANT WITHOUT A SEAT UNDER 2 -\\nCHARGE 10 PERCENT OF THE FARE.\\nTICKET DESIGNATOR - IN.\\nMUST BE ACCOMPANIED ON ALL FLIGHTS IN SAME\\nCOMPARTMENT BY ADULT 18 OR OLDER.\\nVISIT FRIENDS/RELATIVES CHILD 2-11 - CHARGE 75 PERCENT OF\\nTHE FARE.\\nTICKET DESIGNATOR - CH.\\nMUST BE ACCOMPANIED ON ALL FLIGHTS IN SAME\\nCOMPARTMENT BY VISIT FRIENDS/RELATIVES 18 OR\\nOLDER\\nOR - VIST FRIENDS/RELATIVES INFANT WITH A SEAT UNDER 2 -\\nCHARGE 75 PERCENT OF THE FARE.\\nTICKET DESIGNATOR - IN.\\nMUST BE ACCOMPANIED ON ALL FLIGHTS IN SAME\\nCOMPARTMENT BY VISIT FRIENDS/RELATIVES 18 OR\\nOLDER.\\nNOTE -\\nAN INFANT UNDER TWO YEARS WHO MAY TURN 2 YEARS\\nOF AGE BEFORE THE END OF THE TRIP MUST PAY A\\nCHILD FARE FOR THE ENTIRE JOURNEY\\nOR - 1ST VISIT FRIENDS/RELATIVES INFANT WITHOUT A SEAT\\nUNDER 2 - CHARGE 10 PERCENT OF THE FARE.\\nTICKET DESIGNATOR - IN.\\nMUST BE ACCOMPANIED ON ALL FLIGHTS IN SAME\\nCOMPARTMENT BY VISIT FRIENDS/RELATIVES 18 OR\\nOLDER.\"},{\"name\":\"22. ALL OTHER DISCOUNTS\",\"value\":\"NONE UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED\"},{\"name\":\"23. MISCELLANEOUS PROVISIONS\",\"value\":\"BETWEEN AREA 1 AND AREA 2\\nTHIS FARE MUST NOT BE USED AS THE HIGH OR THE LOW FARE\\nWHEN CALCULATING A DIFFERENTIAL. THIS FARE MUST NOT BE\\nUSED AS THE THROUGH FARE WHEN PRICING A FARE COMPONENT\\nWITH A DIFFERENTIAL.\"},{\"name\":\"31. VOLUNTARY CHANGES\",\"value\":\"DO A CATEGORY 31 SPECIFIC TEXT ENTRY TO VIEW CONTENTS\\nALSO REFERENCE 16 PENALTIES - FOR ADDITIONAL CHANGE INFORMATION\"},{\"name\":\"33. VOLUNTARY REFUNDS\",\"value\":\"UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED   NOTE - RULE 0033 IN IPRG\\nAPPLIES\\nBETWEEN AREA 2 AND AREA 1\\nREFUND MAY BE REQUESTED ANYTIME.\\nFARE IS NONREFUNDABLE. IF THERE IS A MIX OF PENALTY\\nAPPLICATIONS, THE MOST RESTRICTIVE APPLIES TO THE ENTIRE\\nJOURNEY.\\nREPRICE USING EQUAL OR HIGHER RBD.\"}]}],\"Identifier\":{\"value\":\"o2_FR\"},\"ReferenceList\":[{\"@type\":\"ReferenceListFlight\",\"Flight\":[{\"@type\":\"FlightDetail\",\"distance\":931,\"duration\":\"PT2H45M\",\"carrier\":\"UX\",\"number\":\"1518\",\"equipment\":\"7M8\",\"id\":\"s45\",\"Departure\":{\"@type\":\"DepartureDetail\",\"terminal\":\"1\",\"location\":\"MUC\",\"date\":\"2026-03-27\",\"time\":\"19:05:00\"},\"Arrival\":{\"@type\":\"ArrivalDetail\",\"terminal\":\"2\",\"location\":\"MAD\",\"date\":\"2026-03-27\",\"time\":\"21:50:00\"},\"AvailabilitySourceCode\":\"Q\"},{\"@type\":\"FlightDetail\",\"distance\":3582,\"duration\":\"PT8H15M\",\"carrier\":\"UX\",\"number\":\"91\",\"equipment\":\"788\",\"id\":\"s46\",\"Departure\":{\"@type\":\"DepartureDetail\",\"terminal\":\"1\",\"location\":\"MAD\",\"date\":\"2026-03-28\",\"time\":\"15:35:00\"},\"Arrival\":{\"@type\":\"ArrivalDetail\",\"terminal\":\"4\",\"location\":\"JFK\",\"date\":\"2026-03-28\",\"time\":\"18:50:00\"},\"AvailabilitySourceCode\":\"Q\"}]}]}}', 200, 0.631975, '2026-03-23 08:21:36'),
